          "comment": "Loves it here and comes here in good order; new headgear could be a positive; contender",
          "spotlight": "Six of her nine wins have come here and she has had a couple of near misses this time around, including when second to Papabella over C&D 31 days ago; 3lb better off with that rival today and possible a change of headgear will help (won when tried in cheekpieces for the first time and also when wearing a tongue-tie for the first time); contender.",
