          "comment": "Met trouble in two Listed races since his impressive debut win; major player down in grade",
          "spotlight": "Looked good when winning a Wetherby maiden on last month's debut (5.5f, good to firm); met trouble at Royal Ascot and then again when fifth of seven (beaten 4l) in the Listed Dragon Stakes at Sandown two weeks ago; still open to improvement and he's in calmer waters this time; big chance for last year's winning stable.",
