          "comment": "1lb wrong under penalty for Ayr win; major player, all the more so if the ground eases",
          "spotlight": "Won twice last year, including here (1m1f, soft), and after having undergone wind surgery in the spring he stepped up from his reappearance when successful at Ayr (1m, soft) 11 days ago; just 1lb wrong under his penalty and a major player, all the more so if the ground eases.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-07-06",
              "horse": "Theoryofeverything",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32443565",
              "race": "Summer Mile Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11664978",
              "course": "Ayr",
              "course_id": "crs_78",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Theoryofeverything was down in grade but had to give a lot of weight to three-year-olds so it was a good effort. I think he's changed this year, he's a lot sharper and hopefully there's a lot more to come - Danny Tudhope, jockey, speaking on Racing TV."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-04-02",
              "horse": "Theoryofeverything",
              "horse_id": "hrs_32443565",
              "race": "Made In Doncaster St Leger Novice Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_10848591",
              "course": "Doncaster",
              "course_id": "crs_390",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1546",
              "quote": "Theroryofeverything handled the ground well, that was the key. I won the Atalanta Stakes on his mother on soft ground and she won the QEII and was a really decent filly. Let's just hope that's not his be all and end all. He travelled well into the race after overcoming a bit of greenness early on. He's got a really good mind on him, let's hope he can build on it - Robert Havlin, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He looked really good one day at Ascot last year when he was held up on soft ground. He definitely needs it slow and that will be a big factor for him. His work is probably better than it was last year. 14-04-25"
            }
          ],
