          "comment": "3lb below last winning mark, but just one win in his last 23 starts",
          "spotlight": "3lb lower than when winning at York (1m, soft) last October so rain would be a positive, but that his only success in his last 23 starts; recent efforts raise doubts as to whether he can capitalise on his sliding mark.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-10-11",
              "horse": "Empirestateofmind",
              "horse_id": "hrs_22413538",
              "race": "William Hill Top Price Guarantee Autumn Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11397906",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1732",
              "quote": "We were getting Empirestateofmind ready for the Lincoln when he injured a hock and that put him on the back foot. We thought he'd run well in the Cambridgeshire but he was drawn in the middle and he was a bit fresh. He always needs a run. It's good to get him back. He's in the Balmoral Handicap next week and he'll run if he gets in - John Quinn, joint-trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-07-30",
              "horse": "Empirestateofmind",
              "horse_id": "hrs_22413538",
              "race": "William Hill Summer Cup Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10608650",
              "course": "Thirsk",
              "course_id": "crs_2080",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1758",
              "quote": "Empirestateofmind bumped into one at Newcastle last Saturday and he deserved that, he's so consistent. This is a very nice race to win - Ross Harmon, owner."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "Unfortunately he won't be able to run in the Lincoln, which he finished seventh in last year, as he needed three weeks of rest at just the wrong time. He could be out in May and he's a good handicapper when the ground gets soft. He's been a victim of his consistency over the last 18 months as his mark didn't come down even though he didn't win, but he starts now lower than he did last year and I don't imagine he's any worse, so I hope he can win a nice handicap at some stage. 20-03-24"
            }
          ],
