          "comment": "2m3f hurdles winner; well beaten in three starts for this trainer; handy mark as a result.",
          "spotlight": "Dual hurdles winner at around 2m3f (stays 2m4f); well beaten in all three starts for this trainer; handy mark as a result and support for him would be interesting.",
