          "comment": "C&D winner; not a bad run over 2m at Wexford last time and is one to consider back here",
          "spotlight": "The last of his three hurdle wins came over C&D last August off 2lb higher; not a bad run over 2m at Wexford last time and is one to consider at a course he operates over.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-08-25",
              "horse": "Swelltime",
              "horse_id": "hrs_15451499",
              "race": "Racing Next At Navan On Saturday September 3rd Handicap (Div II)",
              "race_id": "rac_10661261",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "14",
              "distance_y": "3080",
              "quote": "I thought Swelltime was my best ride of the day. He's developed and matured into doing his bit, so it's nice that owners can give them a bit of time to strengthen. When they age, if they have ability they will thrive. He ran very well at Tramore last time - Seamie Heffernan, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-07-20",
              "horse": "Swelltime",
              "horse_id": "hrs_15451499",
              "race": "Connolly's Red Mills Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_9918181",
              "course": "Gowran Park",
              "course_id": "crs_4784",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "He might head to Galway for a 1m6f handicap on the Flat. He's a nice horse who obviously stays well. Possibly something like the Lartigue Hurdle could suit him. You can make plenty of use of him over two miles - Joe Murphy jnr, assistant to Joe Murphy, trainer of Swelltime"
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-06-14",
              "horse": "Swelltime",
              "horse_id": "hrs_15451499",
              "race": "La Bucca Restaurants Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "rac_9533433",
              "course": "Fairyhouse",
              "course_id": "crs_4732",
              "distance_f": "12",
              "distance_y": "2640",
              "quote": "We fancied him a little, although not as much as it might seem. He's very one paced but he stays going well, and I'd say he'll jump a hurdle in time. We decided to make use of his strength which was going to be staying and he kept on well - Joe Murphy jnr, assistant and son of Joe Murphy, trainer"
            }
          ],
