          "comment": "Progressive 1m handicapper but this a big step up in class",
          "spotlight": "Progressive handicapper, scoring over 1m at Naas and the Curragh in the spring; keen and didn't get home over 1m1f at latter venue last month; big step up in class here; fourth yesterday at Killarney (6.40).",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-25",
              "horse": "Shiota",
              "horse_id": "hrs_42195510",
              "race": "QuinnBet Spring Fillies Handicap (Premier Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11648884",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "I wasn't sure if Shiota had got there so I was delighted to hear them call out number three. I thought we had a little bit more up our sleeves coming here. She has come up the ranks. There is a Listed race in Killarney for her next race and we will work from there. She's a nice filly and were talking about maybe running her in the Britannia but we will see. Who knows how high she can go. There is always a lot of competition with fillies and when the O'Brien brigade come out they have always two or three in front of you or somewhere near you so we kind of like a fisherman with one hook - Joseph Murphy, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-07-06",
              "horse": "Shiota",
              "horse_id": "hrs_42195510",
              "race": "Irish EBF Median Sires Series Race (IRE Incentive Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11335090",
              "course": "Naas",
              "course_id": "crs_4992",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1305",
              "quote": "Shiota is more of a three-year-old. She is growing like mad and I think seven is ideal for her. We ran her here to familiarise herself with Naas before the Ballyhane Stakes next month - Joe Murphy, trainer."
            }
          ],
